Title: Judge's Crossword Puzzle No. 18
Author: J. R. Birchfield
Date: 1925-02-28
Byline: The above Puzzle was contributed by J. R. Birchfield, Apartment 40, 450 Audubon avenue, New York, N. Y.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1925-02-28_88/page/n34/mode/1up
